    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Zodiac Requiem&quot; is a top-down shooter RPG based on the Chinese zodiac. You play as Lin Xiaoman, a mysterious girl who embarks on a perilous journey through thorns and trials to uncover the truth about her origins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Zodiac Requiem</i> features a <strong>top-down perspective</strong> with a <strong>mini-map UI</strong>, allowing players to clearly track their surroundings and enemy movements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697210/extras/9f0b91608eadb7b8203dd8988292ed41.avif?t=1748704586\" width=616 height=346 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Maps are <strong>procedurally generated</strong>, ensuring unique exploration experiences even in repeated areas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697210/extras/a4fa7db1c2e157fac7275242108cba37.avif?t=1748704586\" data-has-big width=800 height=472 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemies drop <strong>weapons of varying rarities and affixes</strong>, with 12 major weapon classes (rifles, sniper rifles, pistols, etc.) and detailed subclass customization.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697210/extras/9dc30808dbcf71ff7e98fc8eb74ae145.avif?t=1748704586\" width=616 height=992 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge 12 <strong>Zodiac-themed final bosses</strong> \u2013 experiment with weapon builds to conquer these <strong>Souls-like difficulty encounters</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697210/extras/2ec9b47fcea7140d6f0fd630bca20153.avif?t=1748704586\" width=616 height=580 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Zodiac Requiem&quot; is a top-down shooter RPG based on the Chinese zodiac. You play as Lin Xiaoman, a mysterious girl who embarks on a perilous journey through thorns and trials to uncover the truth about her origins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Zodiac Requiem</i> features a <strong>top-down perspective</strong> with a <strong>mini-map UI</strong>, allowing players to clearly track their surroundings and enemy movements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697210/extras/9f0b91608eadb7b8203dd8988292ed41.avif?t=1748704586\" width=616 height=346 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Maps are <strong>procedurally generated</strong>, ensuring unique exploration experiences even in repeated areas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697210/extras/a4fa7db1c2e157fac7275242108cba37.avif?t=1748704586\" data-has-big width=800 height=472 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemies drop <strong>weapons of varying rarities and affixes</strong>, with 12 major weapon classes (rifles, sniper rifles, pistols, etc.) and detailed subclass customization.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697210/extras/9dc30808dbcf71ff7e98fc8eb74ae145.avif?t=1748704586\" width=616 height=992 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge 12 <strong>Zodiac-themed final bosses</strong> \u2013 experiment with weapon builds to conquer these <strong>Souls-like difficulty encounters</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697210/extras/2ec9b47fcea7140d6f0fd630bca20153.avif?t=1748704586\" width=616 height=580 /></span></p>",
